# valgrind memcheck suppressions for fussC.
#
# Scope is deliberately tight: the CI job runs with
#   --leak-check=full --errors-for-leak-kinds=definite
# so only *definite* leaks fail the build. "Still reachable" blocks from
# libgit2/OpenSSL/zlib one-time global init are not errors and need no entry.
#
# Add a suppression here ONLY for a confirmed false positive inside a third-party
# library (never to hide a leak in our own code). Each entry must carry a comment
# explaining why it is safe. None needed so far.
